    {
      "flavor_text": "ほっぺたに　どくぶくろを　もつ。\nあいての　すきを　ついて　もうどくを\nにじませている　ゆびを　つきさす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "볼에 독주머니를 가지고 있다.\n상대의 틈을 노려 맹독이\n배인 손가락을 꿰찌른다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses joues contiennent des glandes toxiques.\nIl attaque par surprise et utilise son toucher\nempoisonné.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In seinen Backen sammelt sich Gift. Es versucht,\nBeute zu überraschen und mit Giftfingern zu\nschnappen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tiene bolsas venenosas en las mejillas. Pilla\ndesprevenidos a sus rivales para pincharles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le sacche delle guance contengono veleno.\nInfilza i nemici con le sue unghie avvelenate.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its cheeks hold poison sacs. It tries to catch foes\noff guard to jab them with toxic fingers.",
      "language": {
